# Skill routing

`AGENT-INSTRUCTIONS.md` sections 3-4 own salary, CV blocks, dedupe, and form limits. Read them before any application form.

Browser agents run one at a time. LinkedIn and GitHub URLs use an `https://` prefix. Required text areas stay filled. Stop on a CAPTCHA and hand it to Prabhavit.

## Use these

- Scrape: `.claude/skills/job-scraper` and `.agents/skills/*-search`
- Apply: `.claude/skills/apply`
- CV: `.claude/skills/tailor-resume`
- Tracker views: `.claude/commands/gmail-sync.md` and `notion-sync.md`. Stop at their preflight when Gmail or Notion MCP is absent.
- Telegram: `.claude/skills/jobsearch-telegram`
- Employer research: `.claude/skills/network-scan` and `.claude/skills/job-application-assistant/09-web-research.md`
- Interview prep: `.claude/skills/job-application-assistant/07-interview-prep.md`

## Skip these catalog copies

- `.claude/skills/company-researcher` is the sales Lead Research Assistant.
- `.claude/skills/interview-analyzer` is the meeting-insights skill.
- Skip Tailored Resume Generator, File Organizer, n8n-skills, and LinkedIn Automation. LinkedIn stays on `linkedin-search` plus the outreach lists.
- Skip the Composio CRM, marketing, and social automation packs.

## Pull only when the task needs them

- `xlsx` and `pdf` from `anthropics/skills`, for lead workbooks and compiled CV checks.
- `article-extractor`, when a posting page returns a shell.
- Chrome Relay, when the form needs the signed-in Chrome session (join.com, Ashby). Install only after Prabhavit asks. This browser tab does not share those cookies.
